/// \class EnragedBehavior
/// \ingroup grp_w1022_behavior_module_factories_a
/// \brief Behavior module registered as "EnragedBehavior": an update module
///        with a single field, \c EnragedLifeTimer.
///
/// Its registered data factory is not documented in this group; the field
/// table it parses holds one real, \c EnragedLifeTimer. The name and field suggest
/// an enraged state that lasts for a time; this page does not describe
/// the module's logic. BFME 1 already has the class.
///
/// \see EnragedBehavior::friend_newModuleInstance

/// \fn Module *EnragedBehavior::friend_newModuleInstance(Thing *thing, const ModuleData *moduleData)
/// \brief Instance factory registered for "EnragedBehavior": creates the
///        module for one object.
///
/// ModuleFactory::newModule calls it through the registration. The group
/// page describes the shared frame.
///
/// \param thing       The object being built; the module keeps it as its
///                    owner.
/// \param moduleData  The template's module data for this module line.
/// \return The new module as the Module base the factory stores, or null
///         when the allocation fails.
